      "statement": "The pipeline expands environment variables in YAML configuration, selects the first agent matching a role, substitutes prompt placeholders, and runs the configured command from `kb_root`. In a full source run it runs ingest and review first, groups only that source's persisted draft verdicts, and runs promote with the exact verified list followed by topics only when that list is nonempty; a failed dispatched step stops the run.",
